SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

This MIT License covers the original code and original documentation of this
project only: everything under src/, scripts/, tests/, configs/, schemas/,
docs/, data/mapping/, and the retrieval manifests under
data/raw/_manifests/, all of which are this project's own work.

It does NOT cover, and does not purport to relicense, any third-party
material. In particular it grants no rights whatsoever in:

  - World Bank documents and datasets (Pink Sheet workbooks and archived
    monthly issues);
  - Office of the National Economic and Social Development Council (NESDC)
    workbooks and publications, including the 2015 input-output table;
  - Office of Industrial Economics (OIE) documents, index workbooks and the
    Manufacturing Production Index and Capacity Utilisation data derived from
    them;
  - Energy Policy and Planning Office (EPPO) price-structure workbooks;
  - any other third-party dataset or publication.

No file from any of those publishers is redistributed in this repository. What
is published instead is the code that retrieves them, their source URLs, and a
SHA-256 checksum for each file that was retrieved. Their terms are the
publishers' to state and are recorded, unresolved where they are unresolved, in
DATA_SOURCES.md and docs/e2_data_license_review.md.
